\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. This, this is the God we adore,
\par Our faithful, unchangeable friend;
\par Whose love is as great as His power,
\par And neither knows measure nor end.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. 'Tis Jesus, the first and the last,
\par Whose Spirit shall guide us safe home;
\par We'll praise Him for all that is past,
\par And trust Him for all that's to come.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

